# Project Instructions

This is a personal guitar lesson management application.

The application is intentionally small and pragmatic.

Do not introduce:
- microservices
- event buses
- CQRS
- message brokers
- Redis
- Kubernetes
- unnecessary abstractions
- speculative features

Prefer:
- simple REST APIs
- PostgreSQL
- explicit domain rules
- small services
- strong database constraints
- automated tests
- readable code

Business rules are defined in:
docs/business-rules.md

The domain model is defined in:
docs/domain.md

Do not invent business rules.
If an implementation requires a business decision not documented there,
stop and explicitly identify the decision.